WEBVTT

00:05:30.242 --> 00:05:33.204
Higher stakes -- more storylines,

00:05:33.245 --> 00:05:34.997
and on and up we go.

00:05:36.415 --> 00:05:40.836
Every so often,
a female athlete or a team,

00:05:40.836 --> 00:05:42.588
they will hit the tipping point.

00:05:43.339 --> 00:05:46.634
We understand their storylines,
we’ve got the stakes.

00:05:46.634 --> 00:05:50.346
Here, I'm thinking Serena Williams,
Simone Biles, Ronda Rousey,

00:05:51.305 --> 00:05:52.473
Megan Rapinoe.

00:05:53.599 --> 00:05:54.767
Right?

00:05:54.767 --> 00:05:56.477
These are the outliers.

00:05:57.395 --> 00:05:59.688
And having representation matters.